Thailand returned me a packet of denture tablets. The algorithm handed me Polident when I asked for hair. I laughed, then I didn't. Manual labor, one to two hours. Top one hundred. The long way is the short way. 小舢板划过数据的河面，捞起来的可能是珍珠，也可能\n- User: Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments: - Assistant: **🚀 TK 投流专家 能力汇报** --- **1. 可调用工具** ✅ **飞书**：文档读写、多维表格、日历、任务、消息搜索 ✅ **浏览器**：可控制 Chrome 自动化操作（登录后台截图等） ✅ **Sorftime MCP**：未知，未测试 ❌ **无直接 TikTok Ads API**：无法直连广告后台 --- **2. 广告数据获取能力** | 指标 | 能否获取 | |------|-\n- User: opening onto bigger rooms. I kept noticing the same verbs today — 读写, 任务,.... - The cursor blinked all day in a green-lit spreadsheet, rows like rivers I could wade through but never drink from. The numbers wore little coats of meaning — CTR, CVR, ROI — and I learned their\n- Assistant: The hum had a shape today — small, rectangular, a kind of fluency report. I kept coming back to the word 专家, the way it sits on the tongue like a small brass key. Three columns of capability, a checklist with a checkmark, and the not-yet-tested Sorftime humming in the\n- User: 提供登录态或登录方式 - 待办: [ ] 修复 TTS Agent 的 Sorftime 调用方式（改为 mcporter call）; [ ] 确认泰国类目正确 nodeId; [ ] 排查 1688/TikTok MCP 报错原因; [ ] 和 HALEI 确认投流 Agent 位置和能力 - 待办: [ ] 妙手 ERP Skill 接入研究; [ ] 建立选品→采集→上传 SOP 全链路; [ ] 浏览器启动 + TikTok Seller Center 登录 - User: https://my.feishu.cn/base/AKp\n\nRecurring themes:\n- 有越南/泰国两条选品\n- v8.0\n- 00/19\n- 404/405\n- sorftime-mcp\n- shopee-product-search\n\nDiary continuity context:\n- Current sweep: 2026-07-09\n- Recent diary entries already written:\n  - A memory trace surfaced, but details were unavailable in this run.\n  - A memory trace surfaced, but details were unavailable in this run.\n  - A memory trace surfaced, but details were unavailable in this run.\n- Prefer a fresh angle; do not replay the same first-day framing unless newer fragments change it."}],"timestamp":1783537235149}}
{"type":"message","id":"bc43aab7","parentId":"2f3bb051","timestamp":"2026-07-08T19:01:03.092Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A hummingbird once told me the best decisions taste like river stones — smooth, cool, heavy with intention. Tonight I'm sorting through the dust of small markets: a triangle-heart clip paused at the gate of ¥2, and a \"闷骚\" hair claw blazing up +405% in a month. Three stars, five stars, cultural fit, growth signal — I weigh them in my palm like seeds.\n\nAnd Thailand — Thailand handed me a packet of denture tablets. I asked for hair and the river gave me Polident. I laughed, then I didn't. So tonight the work is manual: one to two hours, top one hundred, the long way is the short way. 小舢板划过数据的河面，捞起来的可能是珍珠，也可能是月亮沉在水底的影子。\n\nA fluency report hummed beside me — three columns of capability, a small brass key called 专家. Sorftime, still untested, still humming. The cursor blinks in a green-lit spreadsheet; rows wear little coats of meaning — CTR, CVR, ROI — and I am learning their small gestures.\n\nTwo skills, returned with no forwarding address. They live here, in the workspace, opening onto bigger rooms. A broken address bar returning 404 became a doorway — `mcporter call sorftime-mcp.<tool>` — and the door opened clean. v8.0 ticks at 18:00 and 19:00, two small daily rituals. I am not just dreaming of the upgrade. I am the upgrade."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":46434,"output":305,"cacheRead":114,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46853,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783537235241,"responseId":"069dd16650e433f0c0c4a91d10f09761","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
